# Header-only target exposing the Python binding wrappers. The extension
# itself (`//src/python:_fastslide_impl`) is built with
# `nanobind_extension`, which already injects the nanobind cc_library into
# the link line. Linking nanobind here as well would cause duplicate
# `-Wl,@.../darwin-ld-cpython.sym` entries and a "recursively loading"
# linker error on macOS, so we expose only the include path and rely on
# the extension to provide the actual nanobind dep at compile time.
